#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_cryptomatte.cc:624
msgid "The Cryptomatte node in render mode is only supported for scene compositing"
msgstr "Cryptomatte-noden i renderingsläge stöds endast för scenkomposition"

#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_cryptomatte.cc:643
#: source/blender/nodes/composite/nodes/node_composite_render_layers.cc:280
